---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import TermWindow from '../components/TermWindow.astro';

const GAME_URL = 'https://itzi97.github.io/engine2d/2d-engine.html';
---

<PageLayout
	title="Tiny Ski | Itziar Morales"
	description="A 2D ski game built on my own C++/SDL3 engine, compiled to WebAssembly. Playable in the browser: procedural courses, three difficulties, and a yeti."
>
	<p class="eyebrow">~/tinyski</p>
	<h1>Tiny Ski</h1>
	<p class="intro">
		A little ski game running on my own engine, compiled to WebAssembly and playable right here.
	</p>

	<div class="game-desktop">
		<TermWindow title="~/tinyski — 2d-engine (wasm)">
			<iframe
				src={GAME_URL}
				title="Tiny Ski, running in the browser"
				allow="autoplay; fullscreen; gamepad"
				allowfullscreen
				loading="lazy"
				scrolling="no"
			></iframe>
		</TermWindow>
		<p class="focus-hint">
			Click the game once to hand it your keyboard. The third dot in the titlebar goes fullscreen
			(Esc leaves fullscreen, so use P for the pause menu while in it). If the game fails to load,
			the engine's latest build is still deploying; try again in a minute.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="game-mobile">
		<a class="play-btn" href="https://itzi97.github.io/engine2d/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PLAY TINY SKI ↗</a>
		<p class="play-note">
			Opens in a new tab, portrait mode. Use your browser's "Add to Home Screen" to install it as a
			fullscreen offline app.
		</p>
	</div>

	<h2>Controls</h2>
	<ul class="controls">
		<li><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> <kbd>↑</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd><span>steer / shift gear</span></li>
		<li><kbd>Enter</kbd><span>select</span></li>
		<li><kbd>P</kbd><span>pause</span></li>
		<li><kbd>R</kbd><span>retry</span></li>
		<li><kbd>-</kbd> <kbd>+</kbd><span>volume</span></li>
		<li><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>menu</span></li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How it's made</h2>
	<p>
		Tiny Ski runs on <a href="https://github.com/itzi97/engine2d" target="_blank" rel="noopener">engine2d</a>,
		the 2D engine I've been building from scratch: C++20 on SDL3 with a flat ECS, all gameplay
		scripted in Lua through sol2. The engine compiles to WebAssembly, and a GitHub Actions workflow
		rebuilds and republishes the game on every push, so what you're playing above is always the
		latest build.
	</p>
	<p>
		Courses are procedurally generated in Tiled's map format, with three difficulties and
		synthesized sound effects. There is also a yeti, in the SkiFree tradition. Skiers who dawdle
		will meet it.
	</p>
	<p class="credits">
		Art: <a href="https://kenney.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kenney</a>'s Tiny Ski pack (CC0).
		Source on <a href="https://github.com/itzi97/engine2d" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
	</p>

	<style>
		.intro {
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}
		.game-desktop {
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}
		.game-desktop iframe {
			display: block;
			width: 100%;
			height: min(80dvh, 600px);
			border: 0;
			background: #050505;
		}
		.game-mobile {
			display: none;
		}
		@media (max-width: 700px) {
			.game-desktop {
				display: none;
			}
			.game-mobile {
				display: block;
				margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-hot);
				border-radius: 6px;
				background: var(--surface);
				padding: 1.2em 1.3em;
				text-align: center;
			}
			.play-btn {
				display: inline-block;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 1.05em;
				letter-spacing: 0.04em;
				color: var(--accent-hot);
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.play-btn:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}
			.play-note {
				margin: 0.6em 0 0;
				font-size: 0.8em;
				color: var(--text-muted);
			}
		}
		.focus-hint {
			font-size: 0.82em;
			color: var(--text-muted);
			margin-top: 0.6em;
		}
		.controls {
			list-style: none;
			padding: 0;
			margin: 0;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.45em;
		}
		.controls li {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 0.7em;
			font-size: 0.9em;
		}
		.controls span {
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}
		kbd {
			font-family: var(--font-mono);
			font-size: 0.82em;
			background: var(--surface);
			border: 1px solid var(--border);
			border-bottom-width: 2px;
			border-radius: 4px;
			padding: 0.1em 0.5em;
			color: var(--accent);
		}
		.credits {
			font-size: 0.85em;
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}
	</style>
</PageLayout>
